-        $$
-        where $m_{ar}$ is a dynamic boundary adjustment margin [S1].
-    *   **Dynamic Boundary Adjustment ($m_{ar}$):**
-        $$
-        m_{ar} = \alpha \cdot \frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^{N} |\hat{d}_r^{k_1}[i] - \hat{d}_r^{k_2}[i]|
